2x T1  [[Uncommon Weapons|Uncommons]] ([https://supremevalues.com Supreme])|theme=common}}Chick is a [[Common Weapons|common]] knife that is currently obtainable by collecting 4 [[Rare Eggs]], then claiming it from the [[Easter Event 2025]] Rare Egg Tier Rewards.

== Appearance ==
This is one of the commons in the 2025 Easter Event. The bottom of the blade is white and has a crack in the middle to represent an egg, the top of the blade is yellow and has the face of a chick, hence the name.

